 single space station, though it is unclear whether this forms part of a larger spacefaring civilization."},{"zh":"我们探测到了性质不明的读数。这些信号似乎遵循某种重复的句法，这可能表明其源自智慧生命。我们应对此进行进一步调查。信号似乎集中在一艘大型舰船周围，但目前尚不清楚这是否属于某个更庞大的星际文明的一部分。","en":"We have picked up readings of unknown nature. The signals seem to follow some kind of repeating syntax which could indicate sapient origin. It should be investigated further. They seem to be concentrated around a single large vessel, though it is unclear whether this forms part of a larger spacefaring civilization."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/02c1afacf0760697e03b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact_critters.1.A","label":{"zh":"进行研究。","en":"Proceed."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact_critters.5","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-critters-1.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：enclave_stage_2(难度5)","en":"Stage: enclave_stage_2 (difficulty 5)"},"story":"event-first-contact-critters-1"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_NPC_country_types_events.txt","line":13},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"champions_forge_enclave_country","path":"contact_country","value":false}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"champions_forge_enclave_country","path":"contact_country","value":true}]]}],"notes":[{"zh":"审阅注：飞地接触另在 set_first_contact_starting_stage 中安排 720–1080 天后的 leviathans.97（若你不及时完成，他们会主动联系）。","en":"Review note: set_first_contact_starting_stage also schedules leviathans.97 720–1080 days later for enclaves (they contact you if you are too slow).","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"first_contact_critters.5","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"通讯已建立","en":"Communications Established"},"texts":[{"zh":"在成功的翻译了他们的语言之后，我们与[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]的独立空间站建立了通讯。","en":"After successfully translating their language, we h